0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.col592" value="&lt;b&gt;출력 — 내보내는 것&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef0f3;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6572.0" y="2888.0" width="210.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.in0" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/progress (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;progress/2.0 — 놓인 부품 자리(스캔 실물 포함) · 빈 진행표 = 비움&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5990.0" y="2914.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.in1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/scene/attach (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;part_id · 붙이기 / 떼기&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5990.0" y="2995.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.in2" value="&lt;b&gt;robot.yaml · 레시피 ← bringup config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;작업대 상자 · table_z_m · 받침 spare_base_m · 블록 크기&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5990.0" y="3063.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.out0" value="&lt;b&gt;apply_planning_scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;MoveIt2 장면 고침 — 이 노드만&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6572.0" y="2914.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.st0" value="① 작업대 상자 4개(높이 table_z_m = 0.000 · 두께 TABLE_THICK_M 20 mm, E-85) · 받침 상자(spare_base_m · spare_items_m) — 손가락 모델은 없음(손가락 형상은 브링업 URDF)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6246.0" y="2914.0" width="280.0" height="85.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.st1" value="② 진행표 → present 만 장면에 상자로 · absent · 진행표에 없는 블록은 뺌(occluded · unknown 은 그대로) · 빈 진행표([조립] 출발 · [초기화] → [정리 끝])면 장면의 놓인 블록 blk_* 전부 지움 — DONE · 그냥 정지 → 다시 시작은 그대로(E-120)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6246.0" y="3009.0" width="280.0" height="115.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.st2" value="③ 쥔 블록 붙이기(held_quat 방향 — E-100) / 떼서 놓인 부품으로(E-76)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6246.0" y="3134.0" width="280.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1e9e3e;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.104;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="scene_manager.in0" target="scene_manager.st1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="6210.0" y="2949.5"/><mxPoint x="6210.0" y="3021.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="scene_manager.c1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1